From a25f59f0f67f392c40a6c7a4c5b4ccc2d3058983 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:45:22 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: linked battles are four a side (ARENA_LINK4)

The stock link battle exchanges three characters a side. With ARENA_LINK4 it
exchanges four: the lobby sends and receives four unit records, the opponent
Djinn recovery table moves from enemy unit 3 to 4 so it no longer overwrites
the fourth opponent, and the opponents stand where the party stands (mirrored
across the field).

Eight 64x64 characters fill all 512 blocks of sprite VRAM, so the opponents are
drawn from 32x32 sheets (rows 304, 306, 307, 308 of the sprite table, made at
build time from sprites 300 to 303 by scripts/gen-opponent-sprites.py) with no
weapon layer: 16 blocks each. main.ld moves the last ROM region on by 0x5000 for
their pictures; build.ps1 pads the image to match (ROM_END_tbs=0x08805000).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
